  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Investors for Sustainable Development, GISD 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global Investors for Sustainable Development, GISD 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen GISD syftar, i fas tv&#xe5; fr&#xe5;n 2026, till att med investerare och medlemmar i GISD, arbeta med tre pilotl&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r implementering av GISDs globala arbete och rekommendationer. Fokus ligger p&#xe5; att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbara investeringar som landet identifierat, genom att undanr&#xf6;ja hinder och sv&#xe5;righeter samt att skapa incitament f&#xf6;r s&#xe5;dana investeringar. Slutm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r h&#xe5;llbar utveckling, jobbskapande och fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The GISD contribution will, in phase two from 2026,  work with investors and GISD members in three pilot countries to implement GISD&apos;s global work and recommendations and realize investment for sustainable development. The focus is on enabling sustainable investments identified by the country, by removing obstacles and difficulties as well as creating incentives for such investments. The ultimate goal is sustainable development, job creation, and poverty reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
